claim checks_pass;
evidence ci from "a check result";
evidence misread_note from "the result was misread";
readings checks from ci limit 4;
decisions merge limit 2;
event read value min 0 max 1;
event correct;
on read sample checks = value supports checks_pass;
on read when not committed(merge) commit merge because enough using latest(checks);
on correct when not observed(misread_note) reveal misread_note;
on correct withdraw latest(checks) because misread_note;
on correct when committed(merge) and not reopened(merge) and rests_on_withdrawn(merge) reopen merge because misread_note;
